{"id":"a9f0825717f03a8f","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-consistency-statement-construction.md","title":"Consistency Statement Construction","display":"ex-consistency-statement-construction — Consistency Statement Construction","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ex-consistency-statement-construction","aliases":["92-ex-consistency-statement-construction"],"display":"ex-consistency-statement-construction — Consistency Statement Construction","depends_on":["[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]"],"source":"本地数码实例和相容性定义；对照原书第 V 章 pp.60–64；这里采用固定 PA 语言，不能直接替换成原书抽象系统的参数","source_status":"原书相容性概念的本地展开"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-consistency-statement-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-consistency-statement-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-consistency-statement-construction — Consistency Statement Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地数码实例和相容性定义；对照原书第 V 章 pp.60–64；这里采用固定 PA 语言，不能直接替换成原书抽象系统的参数"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相容性概念的本地展开"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> (external proof-code predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> (contradiction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (consistency sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\bot_G\\coloneqq(0=S(0)),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}_G\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\\bigr)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\bot_G\\coloneqq(0=S(0)),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}_G\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{Con}_G\\bigr)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>是对象语言中的一致性句；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\,\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner)\">\\(\\forall k\\,\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner)\\)</span>是其标准模型中的外部数值语义</li>\n<li>前者给<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span>输入数码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner}\">\\(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner}\\)</span>，后者给外部关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>输入自然数编码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner\\)</span></li>\n<li>标准结构统一记为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_G\">\\(\\mathcal N_G\\)</span>不是本书定义过的第二个对象</li>\n<li>当证明码关系原始递归时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>可取为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>句</li>\n<li>在第二不完备性定理的有效性、强度与一致性假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>不能证明这一内部一致性句</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-pr